{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"gpuType":"T4"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"},"accelerator":"GPU"},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"0-NKHM3Eseya"},"source":["# Configuração do Ambiente"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"4T3EaEpHshzU"},"source":["Inicialmente é necessário configurar o Google Colab para utilizar uma GPU (o padrão é usar apenas CPU). Para tal, selecione no menu superior a opção \"**Ambiente de execução > Alterar o tipo de ambiente de execução**\". Em seguida selecione o Acelerador de hardware do tipo GPU e clique em salvar."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["![image.png](data:image/png;base64,)"],"metadata":{"id":"pATdQ40X7lS_"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Executr a célula de código abaixo para verificar a versão do compilador CUDA instalado"],"metadata":{"id":"wsc_bQFPrhH9"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["!nvcc --version"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"5O4_bG2MrgQX","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134480880,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":123,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"63a2eca3-96a0-4511-979e-ca2b362f22ee"},"execution_count":1,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["nvcc: NVIDIA (R) Cuda compiler driver\n","Copyright (c) 2005-2025 NVIDIA Corporation\n","Built on Wed_Aug_20_01:58:59_PM_PDT_2025\n","Cuda compilation tools, release 13.0, V13.0.88\n","Build cuda_13.0.r13.0/compiler.36424714_0\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7_cpmIjOtOZg"},"source":["Execute a célula de código abaixo para verificar se a GPU está disponível para uso"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"WwEqgzeiSe-a","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134483078,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":210,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"838d68c1-0c7c-4d07-81f6-81fb3215c0e9"},"source":["!nvidia-smi"],"execution_count":2,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Sun Oct  4 17:21:24 2026       \n","+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n","| NVIDIA-SMI 580.82.07              Driver Version: 580.82.07      CUDA Version: 13.0     |\n","+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n","| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n","| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n","|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n","|=========================================+========================+======================|\n","|   0  Tesla T4                       Off |   00000000:00:04.0 Off |                    0 |\n","| N/A   43C    P8             11W /   70W |       0MiB /  15360MiB |      0%      Default |\n","|                                         |                        |                  N/A |\n","+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n","\n","+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n","| Processes:                                                                              |\n","|  GPU   GI   CI              PID   Type   Process name                        GPU Memory |\n","|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\n","|=========================================================================================|\n","|  No running processes found                                                             |\n","+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"vwGnyCAdtZdi"},"source":["# Hello World!"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"D4HyCJ7mtsbD"},"source":["A célula de código a seguir irá criar o nosso primeiro arquivo CUDA chamado \"hello_world.cu\"."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Azc9kNbiS8FJ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134505993,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":46,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"c1b864eb-a820-4900-b7a6-76281a143ea5"},"source":["%%file hello_world.cu\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","\n","void helloCPU()\n","{\n","  printf(\"Hello from the CPU.\\n\");\n","}\n","\n","__global__ void helloGPU()\n","{\n","  printf(\"Hello from the GPU.\\n\");\n","}\n","\n","int main()\n","{\n","  helloCPU();\n","  helloGPU<<<1, 1>>>();\n","  cudaDeviceSynchronize();\n","}"],"execution_count":3,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Writing hello_world.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"LKKtsQ5Zssfh"},"source":["Algumas observações importantes sobre o código apresentado acima:\n","*   A função \"helloGPU()\" é do tipo *global*, indicando que ela deverá ser executada na GPU\n","*   A chamada da função \"helloGPU()\" é feita utilizando o bloco de <<< >>>\n","*   Após a chamada da função global é realizada uma sincronização por meio da função \"cudaDeviceSynchronize()\"\n","\n","\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7_qv3VTht1eH"},"source":["A célula de código a seguir irá compilar o nosso arquivo e em seguida irá rodar o executável gerado (flag -run).\n","\n","\n","*   A flag '-arch=sm_75' é necessária para indicar ao compilador gerar um executável para a GPU T4. O CUDA a partir da versão 12 não possui suporte \"automático\" a T4, porém é possível, por meio dessa flag, gerar o executável correspondente.\n","\n","\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"9V-EYHMYTIJa","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134514667,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":2830,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"54539160-c5f7-4adf-bb19-19aeb2623818"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -o hello_world hello_world.cu -run"],"execution_count":4,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Hello from the CPU.\n","Hello from the GPU.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"0pl5TM6vu4TD"},"source":["Experimente trocar os valores dentro do bloco de três <<< >>>.\n","\n","O que acontece com o número de mensagens printadas?"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"kzvau2IEuYc-"},"source":["# Alguns Exemplos"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"E3aCrMIhxdZv"},"source":["Passando parâmetros para função global"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"3gu683_2q1yY","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134530341,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":8,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"b30547dc-5a94-4239-e31b-9769aaf1413f"},"source":["%%file teste_parametros.cu\n","\n","/*\n"," * Copyright 1993-2010 NVIDIA Corporation.  All rights reserved.\n"," *\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation and its licensors retain all intellectual property and\n"," * proprietary rights in and to this software and related documentation.\n"," * Any use, reproduction, disclosure, or distribution of this software\n"," * and related documentation without an express license agreement from\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation is strictly prohibited.\n"," *\n"," * Please refer to the applicable NVIDIA end user license agreement (EULA)\n"," * associated with this source code for terms and conditions that govern\n"," * your use of this NVIDIA software.\n"," *\n"," */\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","\n","__global__ void add(int a, int b, int *c) {\n","    *c = a + b;\n","}\n","\n","int main() {\n","    int c;\n","    int *dev_c;\n","    cudaMalloc((void**)&dev_c, sizeof(int));\n","\n","    add<<<1,1>>>(2, 7, dev_c);\n","\n","    cudaMemcpy(&c, dev_c, sizeof(int), cudaMemcpyDeviceToHost);\n","    printf(\"2 + 7 = %d\\n\", c);\n","    cudaFree(dev_c);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":5,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Writing teste_parametros.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"x-D5HluUq7uG","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134536813,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":1520,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"42674f4c-87fa-49dd-c966-2c1edae0964d"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -o teste_parametros teste_parametros.cu -run"],"execution_count":6,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["2 + 7 = 9\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"8nredMeOxgsP"},"source":["Utilizando função do tipo *device*"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"FLbKZVRDpB0W","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134538617,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":21,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"529e77da-7028-4971-8846-cab6594ba885"},"source":["%%file teste_device.cu\n","\n","/*\n"," * Copyright 1993-2010 NVIDIA Corporation.  All rights reserved.\n"," *\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation and its licensors retain all intellectual property and\n"," * proprietary rights in and to this software and related documentation.\n"," * Any use, reproduction, disclosure, or distribution of this software\n"," * and related documentation without an express license agreement from\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation is strictly prohibited.\n"," *\n"," * Please refer to the applicable NVIDIA end user license agreement (EULA)\n"," * associated with this source code for terms and conditions that govern\n"," * your use of this NVIDIA software.\n"," *\n"," */\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","\n","__device__ int addem( int a, int b ) {\n","    return a + b;\n","}\n","\n","__global__ void add( int a, int b, int *c ) {\n","    *c = addem( a, b );\n","}\n","\n","int main(){\n","    int c;\n","    int *dev_c;\n","    cudaMalloc((void**)&dev_c, sizeof(int));\n","\n","    add<<<1,1>>>( 2, 7, dev_c );\n","\n","    cudaMemcpy( &c, dev_c, sizeof(int), cudaMemcpyDeviceToHost);\n","    printf(\"2 + 7 = %d\\n\", c);\n","    cudaFree(dev_c);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":7,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Writing teste_device.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"lSNrNKC1pLWb","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134545577,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":1748,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"ef1146b8-6dde-4f7c-9fe1-45c10fbe7ebf"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -o teste_device teste_device.cu -run"],"execution_count":8,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["2 + 7 = 9\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"YNJh0Qt69TXt"},"source":["Coletando informações sobre o número do bloco, da thread e tamanho do bloco"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"bmqXbnxP8S7E","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134546812,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":25,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"08addd67-9e06-4ab8-c22c-8c27f3e809fe"},"source":["%%file teste_thread.cu\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","\n","__global__ void teste()\n","{\n","  printf(\"Bloco = %d Thread = %d Tamanho = %d \\n\", blockIdx.x, threadIdx.x, blockDim.x);\n","}\n","\n","int main()\n","{\n","  teste<<<2, 5>>>();\n","  cudaDeviceSynchronize();\n","}"],"execution_count":9,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Writing teste_thread.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"ihHBWVd_8x5J","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134553831,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":1641,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"1aa8f408-101a-4b4c-aa1e-96c2918997e6"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -o teste_thread teste_thread.cu -run"],"execution_count":10,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Bloco = 0 Thread = 0 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 0 Thread = 1 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 0 Thread = 2 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 0 Thread = 3 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 0 Thread = 4 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 1 Thread = 0 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 1 Thread = 1 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 1 Thread = 2 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 1 Thread = 3 Tamanho = 5 \n","Bloco = 1 Thread = 4 Tamanho = 5 \n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"i1sHRMJhyS0r"},"source":["Soma de elementos de um vetor"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"SalCbqAdyWAJ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134561873,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":27,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"90fe4c76-2a33-42ac-e903-b5ba8e0474d6"},"source":["%%file soma_vet.cu\n","\n","/*\n"," * Copyright 1993-2010 NVIDIA Corporation.  All rights reserved.\n"," *\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation and its licensors retain all intellectual property and\n"," * proprietary rights in and to this software and related documentation.\n"," * Any use, reproduction, disclosure, or distribution of this software\n"," * and related documentation without an express license agreement from\n"," * NVIDIA Corporation is strictly prohibited.\n"," *\n"," * Please refer to the applicable NVIDIA end user license agreement (EULA)\n"," * associated with this source code for terms and conditions that govern\n"," * your use of this NVIDIA software.\n"," *\n"," */\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","\n","#define N   10\n","\n","__global__ void add(int *a, int *b, int *c) {\n","    int tid = blockIdx.x;    // this thread handles the data at its thread id\n","    if (tid < N)\n","        c[tid] = a[tid] + b[tid];\n","}\n","\n","int main() {\n","    int a[N], b[N], c[N];\n","    int i;\n","    int *dev_a, *dev_b, *dev_c;\n","\n","    // allocate the memory on the GPU\n","    cudaMalloc((void**)&dev_a, N * sizeof(int));\n","    cudaMalloc((void**)&dev_b, N * sizeof(int));\n","    cudaMalloc((void**)&dev_c, N * sizeof(int));\n","\n","    // fill the arrays 'a' and 'b' on the CPU\n","    for (i = 0; i < N; i++) {\n","        a[i] = 1;\n","        b[i] = i;\n","    }\n","\n","    // copy the arrays 'a' and 'b' to the GPU\n","    cudaMemcpy(dev_a, a, N * sizeof(int), cudaMemcpyHostToDevice);\n","    cudaMemcpy(dev_b, b, N * sizeof(int), cudaMemcpyHostToDevice);\n","\n","    add<<<N,1>>>(dev_a, dev_b, dev_c);\n","\n","    // copy the array 'c' back from the GPU to the CPU\n","    cudaMemcpy(c, dev_c, N * sizeof(int), cudaMemcpyDeviceToHost);\n","\n","    // display the results\n","    for (int i=0; i<N; i++) {\n","        printf( \"%d + %d = %d\\n\", a[i], b[i], c[i] );\n","    }\n","\n","    // free the memory allocated on the GPU\n","    cudaFree(dev_a);\n","    cudaFree(dev_b);\n","    cudaFree(dev_c);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":11,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Writing soma_vet.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"iloa7G7czISJ","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791134573019,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":1508,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"94208d08-28c0-412a-d67e-4afb47263dbb"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -o soma_vet soma_vet.cu -run"],"execution_count":12,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["1 + 0 = 1\n","1 + 1 = 2\n","1 + 2 = 3\n","1 + 3 = 4\n","1 + 4 = 5\n","1 + 5 = 6\n","1 + 6 = 7\n","1 + 7 = 8\n","1 + 8 = 9\n","1 + 9 = 10\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"oMZMTt4Ksjbt"},"source":["# Exercício: Multiplicação de Matrizes"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"FGP5E4SgzKlt"},"source":["A seguir você irá comparar o desempenho de três versões distintas do algoritmo de multiplicação de matrizs, sendo elas: sequencial, paralela (OpenMP) e GPU. Para cada versão altere o tamanho das matrizes (N = 1024, N  = 2048 e N = 4096) e calcule o *speedup* da versão paralela e GPU em cada caso (tamanho de matriz).\n","\n","speedup_gpu = tempo_seq/tempo_gpu\n","\n","speedup_par = tempo_seq/tempo_par\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"1gZNGhdNDRzT"},"source":["**Versão sequencial da multiplicação de matrizes**"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"wLVkh9OBDV13","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136388658,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":5,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"b3fa5ef6-cc61-4df0-db69-d384e34ecb39"},"source":["%%file mat_mul_seq.c\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","#include <stdlib.h>\n","#include <time.h>\n","\n","#define TIMER_START \\\n","    struct timespec t1; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t1)\n","\n","#define TIMER_STOP \\\n","    struct timespec t2; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t2); \\\n","    double t3 = (t2.tv_sec - t1.tv_sec) + \\\n","                (t2.tv_nsec - t1.tv_nsec) / 1e9; \\\n","    printf(\"Tempo: %.5f s\\n\", t3)\n","\n","#define N 1024\n","\n","int A[N][N], B[N][N], C[N][N];\n","\n","int main()\n","{\n","    int i, j, k;\n","\n","    for(i = 0; i < N; i++){\n","        for(j = 0; j < N; j++){\n","            A[i][j] = (i+j)%10;\n","            B[i][j] = (i+j)%10;\n","            C[i][j] = 0;\n","        }\n","    }\n","\n","    TIMER_START;\n","\n","    for(i = 0; i < N; i++)\n","        for(k = 0; k < N; k++)\n","            for(j = 0; j < N; j++)\n","                C[i][j] = C[i][j] + A[i][k]*B[k][j];\n","\n","    TIMER_STOP;\n","    printf(\"C[0][0]=%d C[%d][%d]=%d  \\n\", C[0][0], N-1, N-1, C[N-1][N-1]);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":51,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Overwriting mat_mul_seq.c\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"1A196rDiDfw1","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136392758,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":507,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"48cfb4f7-b620-4894-d92f-dcf2a160bb91"},"source":["!gcc -O3 -o mat_mul_seq mat_mul_seq.c\n","!./mat_mul_seq"],"execution_count":52,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Tempo: 0.34632 s\n","C[0][0]=29084 C[1023][1023]=29156  \n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"8DbrUQX4DlCY"},"source":["**Versão paralela (OpenMP) da multiplicação de matrizes**\n","\n","OBS: Usar apenas 2 nucleos, que é o máximo disponível no ambiente do Colab"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"sDoMb2E9D8fs","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136400122,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":5,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"5586eb38-5c6b-43e9-d143-95117b1120f5"},"source":["%%file mat_mul_omp.c\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","#include <stdlib.h>\n","#include <omp.h>\n","#include <time.h>\n","\n","#define TIMER_START \\\n","    struct timespec t1; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t1)\n","\n","#define TIMER_STOP \\\n","    struct timespec t2; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t2); \\\n","    double t3 = (t2.tv_sec - t1.tv_sec) + \\\n","                (t2.tv_nsec - t1.tv_nsec) / 1e9; \\\n","    printf(\"Tempo: %.5f s\\n\", t3)\n","\n","#define N 1024\n","\n","int A[N][N], B[N][N], C[N][N];\n","\n","int main()\n","{\n","    int i, j, k;\n","\n","    for(i = 0; i < N; i++){\n","        for(j = 0; j < N; j++){\n","            A[i][j] = (i+j)%10;\n","            B[i][j] = (i+j)%10;\n","            C[i][j] = 0;\n","        }\n","    }\n","\n","    TIMER_START;\n","\n","    #pragma omp parallel for shared(A,B,C) private(i,j,k) num_threads(2)\n","    for(i = 0; i < N; i++)\n","        for(k = 0; k < N; k++)\n","            for(j = 0; j < N; j++)\n","                C[i][j] = C[i][j] + A[i][k]*B[k][j];\n","\n","    TIMER_STOP;\n","    printf(\"C[0][0]=%d  C[%d][%d]=%d  \\n\", C[0][0], N-1, N-1, C[N-1][N-1]);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":53,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Overwriting mat_mul_omp.c\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"ituMbG0ED_hB","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136405323,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":406,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"0222eb10-682d-4c35-efbf-30519ef33eef"},"source":["!gcc -O3 -o mat_mul_omp mat_mul_omp.c -fopenmp\n","!./mat_mul_omp"],"execution_count":54,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Tempo: 0.28332 s\n","C[0][0]=29084  C[1023][1023]=29156  \n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"yUUZwIFyEF31"},"source":["**Versão GPU da multiplicação de matrizes (não otimizada)**"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"ICf-0cETsulF","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136413474,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":18,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"3bf4eaeb-930e-4cb2-e4d4-8543889ed129"},"source":["%%file mat_mul_gpu.cu\n","\n","#include <stdio.h>\n","#include <stdlib.h>\n","#include <time.h>\n","\n","#define TIMER_START \\\n","    struct timespec t1; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t1)\n","\n","#define TIMER_STOP \\\n","    struct timespec t2; \\\n","    clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC, &t2); \\\n","    double t3 = (t2.tv_sec - t1.tv_sec) + \\\n","                (t2.tv_nsec - t1.tv_nsec) / 1e9; \\\n","    printf(\"Tempo: %.5f s\\n\", t3)\n","\n","// Define o tamanho do bloco de threads.\n","// Cada bloco terá TILE_WIDTH x TILE_WIDTH threads.\n","#define TILE_WIDTH 32\n","\n","#define N 1024\n","\n","int *A, *B, *C;\n","\n","/*\n"," * Kernel executado na GPU.\n"," *\n"," * Cada thread é responsável por calcular\n"," * um elemento da matriz C.\n"," */\n","__global__ void matrixMulKernel(int* A, int* B, int* C, int width)\n","{\n","    /*\n","     * Calcula a linha da matriz C que será\n","     * processada pela thread.\n","     *\n","     * blockIdx.y  -> índice do bloco na dimensão Y\n","     * TILE_WIDTH  -> quantidade de threads por dimensão\n","     * threadIdx.y -> índice da thread dentro do bloco\n","     */\n","    int row = blockIdx.y * TILE_WIDTH + threadIdx.y;\n","\n","    // Calcula a coluna da matriz C que será processada pela thread\n","    int col = blockIdx.x * TILE_WIDTH + threadIdx.x;\n","\n","    // Variável que acumula o resultado do produto\n","    int p_value = 0;\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Cada elemento C[row][col] é calculado através\n","     * do produto entre uma linha de A e uma coluna de B:\n","     *\n","     * C[row][col] =\n","     *     A[row][0] * B[0][col] +\n","     *     A[row][1] * B[1][col] +\n","     *     ...\n","     *     A[row][N-1] * B[N-1][col]\n","     */\n","    for (int k = 0; k < width; ++k)\n","      p_value += A[row * width + k] * B[k * width + col];\n","\n","    // Armazena o resultado calculado na matriz C.\n","    C[row * width + col] = p_value;\n","}\n","\n","int main()\n","{\n","    int i, j;\n","    int size;\n","\n","    // Variável utilizada para verificar erros das funções CUDA.\n","    cudaError_t rc;\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Número total de elementos de cada matriz.\n","     *\n","     * Para N = 1024:\n","     *\n","     * size = 1024 * 1024\n","     */\n","    size = N * N;\n","\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Aloca a memória utilizando Unified Memory.\n","     *\n","     * cudaMallocManaged permite que a mesma região de memória\n","     * seja acessada tanto pela CPU quanto pela GPU.\n","     *\n","     * Como as matrizes são int, cada elemento ocupa sizeof(int) bytes.\n","     */\n","    rc = cudaMallocManaged((void**)&A, sizeof(int) * size);\n","\n","    if (rc != cudaSuccess)\n","    {\n","        fprintf(stderr, \"Erro ao alocar A: %s\\n\", cudaGetErrorString(rc));\n","        exit(1);\n","    }\n","\n","    rc = cudaMallocManaged((void**)&B, sizeof(int) * size);\n","\n","    if (rc != cudaSuccess)\n","    {\n","        fprintf(stderr, \"Erro ao alocar B: %s\\n\", cudaGetErrorString(rc));\n","        exit(1);\n","    }\n","\n","    rc = cudaMallocManaged((void**)&C, sizeof(int) * size);\n","\n","    if (rc != cudaSuccess)\n","    {\n","        fprintf(stderr, \"Erro ao alocar C: %s\\n\", cudaGetErrorString(rc));\n","        exit(1);\n","    }\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Inicialização das matrizes.\n","     * Como as matrizes são armazenadas linearmente,\n","     * o elemento [i][j] é acessado como: matriz[i * N + j]\n","     */\n","    for (i = 0; i < N; i++){\n","        for (j = 0; j < N; j++){\n","            A[i * N + j] = (i + j) % 10;\n","            B[i * N + j] = (i + j) % 10;\n","            C[i * N + j] = 0;\n","        }\n","    }\n","\n","    TIMER_START;\n","\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Define as dimensões do Grid.\n","     *\n","     * Cada bloco possui TILE_WIDTH x TILE_WIDTH threads.\n","     *\n","     * Com:\n","     *\n","     * N = 1024\n","     * TILE_WIDTH = 32\n","     *\n","     * teremos:\n","     *\n","     * 1024 / 32 = 32 blocos em cada dimensão.\n","     */\n","    dim3 dimGrid(N / TILE_WIDTH, N / TILE_WIDTH, 1);\n","\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Define o número de threads em cada bloco.\n","     * 32 x 32 = 1024 threads por bloco.\n","     */\n","    dim3 dimBlock(TILE_WIDTH, TILE_WIDTH);\n","\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Executa o kernel na GPU.\n","     *\n","     * dimGrid  -> quantidade de blocos\n","     * dimBlock -> quantidade de threads por bloco\n","     *\n","     * A e B são as matrizes de entrada.\n","     * C é a matriz de saída.\n","     * N é o tamanho das matrizes.\n","     */\n","    matrixMulKernel<<<dimGrid, dimBlock>>>(A, B, C, N);\n","\n","\n","    /*\n","     * Espera a GPU terminar a execução do kernel.\n","     *\n","     * O lançamento de um kernel CUDA é assíncrono.\n","     * Portanto, esta chamada garante que o cálculo\n","     * terminou antes de parar o cronômetro.\n","     */\n","    cudaDeviceSynchronize();\n","\n","    TIMER_STOP;\n","\n","    printf(\"C[0][0]=%d  C[%d][%d]=%d\\n\", C[0], N - 1, N - 1, C[(N - 1) * N + (N - 1)]);\n","\n","    // Libera a memória alocada na GPU/Unified Memory.\n","    cudaFree(A);\n","    cudaFree(B);\n","    cudaFree(C);\n","\n","    return 0;\n","}"],"execution_count":55,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Overwriting mat_mul_gpu.cu\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"FzbJL6pVs0mC","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791136421017,"user_tz":180,"elapsed":1621,"user":{"displayName":"Felipe Valencia","userId":"17176749185726571855"}},"outputId":"28a2b87a-5512-4568-f966-769e5d414283"},"source":["!nvcc -arch=sm_75 -O3 -o mat_mul_gpu mat_mul_gpu.cu -run"],"execution_count":56,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Tempo: 0.00724 s\n","C[0][0]=29084  C[1023][1023]=29156\n"]}]}]}